CLIProxyAPI: access.key-allowlist, a fail-closed per-client-key credential allowlist.

Home dispatch and plugins choose credentials outside the allowlist: Home is
refused while it is set, and the instance module refuses plugins beside it.
Applied with --fuzz=0.
Rationale: packages/cliproxyapi/docs/cliproxyapi-key-allowlist.md.

